### Algorithm 1: Overlap--Backfit

1.  Choose a matching scale $\Lambda_{\mathrm{MTT}}$ and RGE scheme.

2.  Run $(\alpha_1,\alpha_2,\alpha_3)$ from $M_Z$ to
    $\Lambda_{\mathrm{MTT}}$.

3.  Extract ratios
    $$\frac{\zeta_2}{\zeta_1}
