## Prediction for the weak mixing angle

The weak mixing angle is defined by
$$\begin{equation}
\sin^2\theta_W(M_Z)
=
\frac{g'^2(M_Z)}{g'^2(M_Z)+g_2^2(M_Z)}
=
\frac{\tfrac{3}{5}\,g_1^2(M_Z)}
{\tfrac{3}{5}\,g_1^2(M_Z)+g_2^2(M_Z)}.
\label{eq:sin2theta_def}
