This means lens and nil characters are not independent of central-circle
bookkeeping.  The expected relation type is

```text
e_l - a_l e_c = 0,
e_n - a_n e_c = 0.
```

Rows:

```text
(-a_l, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0),
(-a_n, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0).
