positive Mukai charge matrix SNF [7]     PASS
stable sheaf existence on K3             STANDARD THEOREM
stable sheaf sectors for a,b             PROVED
HYM connection                           STANDARD IF LOCALLY FREE/STABLE
Fu-Yau anomaly and MTT selection         OPEN
```

The HYM-summand caveat is checked in:

```text
